SCOPE

This MIT license covers the scan/quarantine scripts and CI tooling authored by
this project: scan_linux.sh, scan_macos.sh, scan_windows.ps1, selftest.sh,
selftest_windows.ps1, and ci/scan_repo.sh, ci/test_ci_scan.sh,
ci/supply-chain-integrity.yml.

